  "subject": "Status: CA-016 Build Directive 1 complete — renderer source extracted from catdef.org/src/index.ts (470 lines of HTML/CSS/JS) and placed at catdef-spec/renderer/index.html with companion README; catdef.org renderPage() rewired to fetch from raw.githubusercontent.com with 5-minute edge cache (matches existing src/mcp/resources.ts pattern); Worker bundle shrank 43% (98.47 KiB → 55.97 KiB); deploy workflow ran green; render.catdef.org live-verified end-to-end including /fetch?url= against raw-JSON canonical; one pre-existing observation flagged on /fetch + CATIO ZIP bundles; one small cleanup item queued for v0.2",

